
# Functions

## AddToCart

An active customer adds a product to the cart when stock and pricing allow.

- Inputs: customer (nat), product (nat)
- Outputs: ok (nat)
- Decomposition: Ecom_AddCart

## Checkout

The customer completes checkout and receives an order receipt.

- Inputs: customer (nat), total (nat)
- Outputs: receipt (nat)

## Refund

Refund a prior order amount when the order id is valid.

- Inputs: order (nat), amount (nat)
- Outputs: cleared (nat)

## ShipOrder

Ship an order and update inventory for the destination region.

- Inputs: order (nat), region (nat)
- Outputs: shipped (nat)

# Data Resources

## ProductId

Natural-number identifier of a catalog product.

## OrderId

Natural-number identifier of a placed order.

## inventory

Map from product id to remaining stock count.

